WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: fr

00:00:03.203 --> 00:00:06.506 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Depuis deux mois, le mot

00:00:04.271 --> 00:00:07.541 size:53% position:73% line:53%
est sur toutes les lèvres.

00:00:05.605 --> 00:00:08.542 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- The variant Omicron...

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.576 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Omicron...

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:10.610 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Le variant Omicron...

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:12.512 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Le variant s'est répandu

00:00:09.910 --> 00:00:13.714 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sur la planète comme

00:00:10.944 --> 00:00:15.315 size:53% position:73% line:53%
une traînée de poudre.

00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:16.516 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Omicron is probably

00:00:14.047 --> 00:00:17.718 size:53% position:73% line:53%
in most countries.

00:00:15.649 --> 00:00:18.952 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Les cas sont plus nombreux

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:20.153 size:53% position:73% line:53%
que jamais. Les systèmes

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:21.388 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de santé craquent.

00:00:19.286 --> 00:00:22.589 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- La situation, dans

00:00:20.387 --> 00:00:23.824 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les prochaines semaines,

00:00:21.722 --> 00:00:25.025 size:53% position:73% line:53%
elle va être critique.

00:00:22.923 --> 00:00:28.061 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Les incertitudes sont

00:00:24.157 --> 00:00:28.061 size:53% position:73% line:53%
nombreuses. Mais que sait-on

00:00:25.359 --> 00:00:28.061 size:53% position:73% line:53%
vraiment sur Omicron?

00:00:32.199 --> 00:00:35.502 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 26 novembre 2021.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:36.737 size:53% position:73% line:53%
La propagation du virus en

00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:37.938 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Afrique du Sud et au Botswana

00:00:35.836 --> 00:00:39.139 size:53% position:73% line:53%
attire l'attention de l'OMS.

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:44.945 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- So today, we are announcing

00:00:38.271 --> 00:00:46.146 size:53% position:73% line:53%
B.1.1.529 is a variant

00:00:39.473 --> 00:00:47.347 size:53% position:73% line:53%
of concern named Omicron.

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:48.582 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Un nouveau variant circule.

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:49.816 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Et sa séquence génétique

00:00:47.681 --> 00:00:51.018 size:53% position:73% line:53%
n'a rien de rassurant.

00:00:48.915 --> 00:00:53.520 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Omicron comporte une

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:54.754 size:53% position:73% line:53%
cinquantaine de mutations

00:00:51.351 --> 00:00:55.956 size:53% position:73% line:53%
par rapport au virus original.

00:00:53.854 --> 00:01:00.494 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Un nombre anormalement élevé.

00:00:55.088 --> 00:01:01.695 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Le variant Delta, par exemple,

00:00:56.289 --> 00:01:02.929 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en compte une quinzaine.

00:01:00.827 --> 00:01:04.131 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Les experts s'inquiètent

00:01:02.028 --> 00:01:05.365 size:53% position:73% line:53%
surtout de l'emplacement

00:01:03.263 --> 00:01:06.566 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de ces mutations.

00:01:04.464 --> 00:01:10.737 size:53% position:73% line:53%
La majorité d'entre elles

00:01:05.699 --> 00:01:11.905 size:53% position:73% line:53%
se situent sur le spicule, une

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:13.106 size:53% position:73% line:53%
protéine à la surface du virus.

00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:14.341 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Le spicule permet au virus

00:01:12.239 --> 00:01:15.542 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de s'accrocher aux cellules

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:16.777 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et de les infecter.

00:01:14.674 --> 00:01:18.011 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Des mutations sur le spicule

00:01:15.876 --> 00:01:19.212 size:53% position:73% line:53%
aident le virus à déjouer

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:25.118 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en partie le système

00:01:18.345 --> 00:01:26.319 size:53% position:73% line:53%
immunitaire, même chez

00:01:19.546 --> 00:01:27.521 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les personnes vaccinées.

00:01:25.452 --> 00:01:32.893 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Par ailleurs, Omicron se répand

00:01:26.653 --> 00:01:34.094 size:53% position:73% line:53%
bien plus vite que le virus

00:01:27.854 --> 00:01:35.328 size:53% position:73% line:53%
original et ses autres variants.

00:01:33.226 --> 00:01:36.530 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Au Québec, il représente 20 %

00:01:34.428 --> 00:01:37.764 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des cas de COVID-19

00:01:35.662 --> 00:01:42.669 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le 12 décembre, et ce taux

00:01:36.863 --> 00:01:43.870 size:53% position:73% line:53%
grimpe à 80 % moins

00:01:38.098 --> 00:01:45.072 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'une semaine plus tard.

00:01:43.003 --> 00:01:46.339 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 En revanche, les données

00:01:44.204 --> 00:01:47.541 size:53% position:73% line:53%
actuelles suggèrent que

00:01:45.405 --> 00:01:48.742 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le variant Omicron cause

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:49.976 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des infections moins sévères,

00:01:47.874 --> 00:01:51.178 size:53% position:73% line:53%
car il infecte les cellules

00:01:49.076 --> 00:01:52.412 size:53% position:73% line:53%
différemment.

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:53.613 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Les coronavirus entrent

00:01:51.511 --> 00:01:54.848 size:53% position:73% line:53%
chez l'humain par le nez

00:01:52.746 --> 00:01:56.049 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et la bouche. En se multipliant,

00:01:53.947 --> 00:01:57.284 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ils descendent le long des voies

00:01:55.182 --> 00:01:58.485 size:53% position:73% line:53%
respiratoires.

00:01:56.383 --> 00:02:01.988 size:53% position:73% line:53%
S'ils se développent dans

00:01:57.617 --> 00:02:03.190 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les poumons et atteignent

00:01:58.818 --> 00:02:06.059 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'autres organes vitaux,

00:02:02.322 --> 00:02:06.059 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des complications graves

00:02:03.523 --> 00:02:06.059 size:53% position:73% line:53%
peuvent survenir.

00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:11.932 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Omicron a toutefois changé

00:02:09.830 --> 00:02:13.166 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de stratégie. Plusieurs études

00:02:11.064 --> 00:02:14.367 size:53% position:73% line:53%
préliminaires remarquent que

00:02:12.265 --> 00:02:15.602 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ce variant peine à infecter

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:16.803 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les poumons. Il se développerait

00:02:14.701 --> 00:02:18.038 size:53% position:73% line:53%
surtout dans le haut

00:02:15.936 --> 00:02:22.509 size:53% position:73% line:53%
du système respiratoire.

00:02:17.137 --> 00:02:23.710 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Cela contribuerait à expliquer

00:02:18.371 --> 00:02:24.945 size:53% position:73% line:53%
plusieurs phénomènes.

00:02:22.842 --> 00:02:26.179 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Plus concentré dans le nez

00:02:24.044 --> 00:02:29.583 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et la gorge, le virus fait

00:02:25.278 --> 00:02:29.583 size:53% position:73% line:53%
moins de dommages et se transmet

00:02:26.513 --> 00:02:29.583 size:53% position:73% line:53%
plus facilement.

00:02:35.422 --> 00:02:38.725 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 À ce jour, on ne sait pas

00:02:36.623 --> 00:02:39.960 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à quel point la vaccination

00:02:37.824 --> 00:02:41.161 size:53% position:73% line:53%
freine cette transmission.

00:02:39.059 --> 00:02:42.395 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Mais une chose est sûre :

00:02:40.293 --> 00:02:47.000 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les vaccins aident le corps

00:02:41.494 --> 00:02:48.235 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à se défendre contre Omicron

00:02:42.729 --> 00:02:49.436 size:53% position:73% line:53%
une fois infecté.

00:02:47.334 --> 00:02:50.670 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Ils rendent les formes graves

00:02:48.568 --> 00:02:51.871 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de COVID-19 moins fréquentes.

00:02:49.769 --> 00:02:53.106 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Selon une étude britannique,

00:02:51.004 --> 00:02:54.307 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les risques d'hospitalisation

00:02:52.205 --> 00:03:00.747 size:53% position:73% line:53%
seraient réduits

00:02:53.440 --> 00:03:00.747 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de 65 % après deux doses

00:02:54.641 --> 00:03:00.747 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et 81 % après trois doses.

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:07.253 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 La vaccination permet donc

00:03:05.152 --> 00:03:08.488 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de désengorger les hôpitaux,

00:03:06.353 --> 00:03:09.689 size:53% position:73% line:53%
mais aussi de prévenir

00:03:07.587 --> 00:03:10.924 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'apparition de nouveaux

00:03:08.822 --> 00:03:15.562 size:53% position:73% line:53%
variants. Car le virus mute plus

00:03:10.023 --> 00:03:16.763 size:53% position:73% line:53%
difficilement dans un organisme

00:03:11.258 --> 00:03:17.998 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en mesure de le combattre.

00:03:15.896 --> 00:03:19.199 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Aussi, selon une étude

00:03:17.097 --> 00:03:20.433 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sud-africaine, les personnes qui

00:03:18.331 --> 00:03:21.635 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ont été infectées par Omicron

00:03:19.533 --> 00:03:25.972 size:53% position:73% line:53%
posséderaient les anticorps

00:03:20.767 --> 00:03:27.174 size:53% position:73% line:53%
nécessaires pour contrer

00:03:21.968 --> 00:03:28.408 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la souche Delta.

00:03:26.306 --> 00:03:29.609 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 La vague Omicron pourrait

00:03:27.507 --> 00:03:30.844 size:53% position:73% line:53%
alors freiner des variants

00:03:28.742 --> 00:03:35.148 size:53% position:73% line:53%
plus agressifs et contribuer

00:03:29.943 --> 00:03:36.383 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à développer une certaine

00:03:31.178 --> 00:03:37.584 size:53% position:73% line:53%
immunité dans la population.

00:03:35.481 --> 00:03:38.818 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Les chances de voir la COVID-19

00:03:36.716 --> 00:03:43.890 size:53% position:73% line:53%
éventuellement disparaître

00:03:37.918 --> 00:03:45.091 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sont minces. Mais la pandémie ne

00:03:39.152 --> 00:03:46.293 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sera pas éternelle pour autant.

00:03:44.224 --> 00:03:47.527 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Si la transmission diminue

00:03:45.425 --> 00:03:48.728 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et se stabilise sur une assez

00:03:46.626 --> 00:03:53.800 size:53% position:73% line:53%
longue durée, la maladie

00:03:47.861 --> 00:03:55.001 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sera déclarée endémique, au même

00:03:49.062 --> 00:03:56.236 size:53% position:73% line:53%
titre que le rhume et la grippe.

00:03:54.134 --> 00:03:57.437 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- To end the acute stage of the

00:03:55.335 --> 00:04:02.742 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pandemic, vaccines need to be

00:03:56.570 --> 00:04:03.944 size:53% position:73% line:53%
shared fairly and quickly with

00:03:57.771 --> 00:04:05.145 size:53% position:73% line:53%
all countries of the world.

00:04:03.076 --> 00:04:06.379 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Au cours des prochains mois,

00:04:04.277 --> 00:04:07.580 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'accès mondial au vaccin

00:04:05.478 --> 00:04:08.815 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sera un enjeu de taille.

00:04:06.713 --> 00:04:10.016 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Il jouera un rôle clé pour mieux

00:04:07.914 --> 00:04:11.218 size:53% position:73% line:53%
contrôler l'évolution du virus.

00:04:09.149 --> 00:04:15.288 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Plus de trois milliard de

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:16.489 size:53% position:73% line:53%
personnes n'ont pas reçu

00:04:11.551 --> 00:04:17.724 size:53% position:73% line:53%
leur première dose.

00:04:15.622 --> 00:04:18.925 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Plusieurs facteurs seront aussi

00:04:16.823 --> 00:04:20.160 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à surveiller, comme les quatre

00:04:18.058 --> 00:04:21.361 size:53% position:73% line:53%
autres variants existants,

00:04:19.259 --> 00:04:26.232 size:53% position:73% line:53%
classés préoccupants,

00:04:20.493 --> 00:04:27.434 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et l'arrivée de médicaments

00:04:21.695 --> 00:04:28.668 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour traiter la COVID-19.

00:04:26.566 --> 00:04:29.869 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Pour l'instant, la suite des

00:04:27.767 --> 00:04:31.104 size:53% position:73% line:53%
choses est difficile à prévoir,

00:04:29.002 --> 00:04:32.105 size:53% position:73% line:53%
car le virus est passé maître

00:04:30.203 --> 00:04:33.139 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dans l'art de déjouer les

00:04:31.438 --> 00:04:37.911 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pronostics. Mais nous apprenons

00:04:32.439 --> 00:04:37.911 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de semaine en semaine

00:04:33.473 --> 00:04:37.911 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à mieux le connaître.

